WEBVTT

00:09:28.037 --> 00:09:31.579
a better job of aggressively interrogating
them both for the good of

00:09:31.579 --> 00:09:34.621
the world, but also for our own
individual self-interest.

00:09:35.037 --> 00:09:37.246
That means that I have to
do that as well. Right.

00:09:37.287 --> 00:09:39.996
Like, this is not just me giving advice
to other people and saying,

00:09:39.996 --> 00:09:41.162
why aren't you doing better?

00:09:41.454 --> 00:09:45.121
It's me looking in the mirror every day
and saying, are you doing better?

00:09:45.329 --> 00:09:48.496
When you look at your business,
are you just saying, well,

00:09:48.496 --> 00:09:51.329
I'm a black guy from the south,
so I'm sure I'm doing fine?

00:09:51.496 --> 00:09:54.579
Or am I saying, you know,
are we good on gender

00:09:54.579 --> 00:09:57.246
or are we making sure that everybody
has a seat at the table?

00:09:57.246 --> 00:09:59.454
Are we making sure that we're
deconstructing the table

00:09:59.454 --> 00:10:02.746
and deconstructing the house and allowing
everybody to rebuild it?